nsights through a modern digital experience.","overview":"SKATYS is a corporate web platform developed to establish and strengthen the company’s digital presence. The website presents the company’s identity, expertise, business solutions, and services while providing an Insights & News section for sharing industry knowledge and company updates. Built with Next.js and Django, the platform combines a modern frontend with a structured backend architecture, supported by PostgreSQL and Docker-based deployment on a production VPS.","conclusion":"Delivered a full-stack corporate website combining company presentation, business solution showcases, content sections, and production infrastructure.","thumbnail":{"src":"/images/skatys/skatys lab.png","alt":"Skatys project thumbnail"},"heroImage":{"src":"/images/skatys/Skatys Website .png","alt":"Skatys project hero preview"},"coverImage":{"src":"/images/skatys/Skatys Website .png","alt":"Skatys project showcase"},"images":[{"src":"/images/skatys/skatys website .png","alt":"Skatys project showcase image 1"},{"src":"/images/skatys/skatys website.png","alt":"Skatys project showcase image 2"},{"src":"/images/skatys/skatys website mobile 3.png","alt":"Skatys project showcase image 3"},{"src":"/images/skatys/skatys website mobile 1.png","alt":"Skatys project showcase image 4"}],"services":["Corporate Website Development","Full-Stack Development","Next.js Frontend","Django Backend & API","Content & Insights Presentation","Docker VPS Deployment"],"serviceSlugs":["web-application-development","django-python-development"],"client":"Skatys Inc.","website":"https://skatys.com/","tags":["Next.js","Django","Python","PostgreSQL","Docker","Corporate Website","Full Stack"],"link":"https://skatys.com/","quote":"A modern corporate digital platform connecting company information, business solutions, and industry insights through a full-stack architecture.","quoteAuthor":"Project Highlights","quoteRole":"Full-Stack Development"},"nextProject":{"slu